  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Cut red onion into thin wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic and mint.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bc44264524ca979207e/step-5d242800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Middle Eastern seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat, then set aside.\n• Place zucchini and onion on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat.\n• Roast veggies until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bc44264524ca979207e/step-9f5bfe10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a medium saucepan over medium heat with half the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bc44264524ca979207e/step-ff0c1c20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, place remaining garlic and butter in a medium heatproof bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until fragrant.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes and mash to combine.\n• Stir in Greek-style yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bc44264524ca979207e/step-75a48430.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir baby spinach leaves and roasted zucchini and onion through the garlic rice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bc44264524ca979207e/step-4ff93440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drizzle the honey over roasted pumpkin.\n• Divide roast veggies and garlic rice between bowls. Top with chermoula-spiced pumpkin.\n• Dollop over fetta yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle with pepitas and mint to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bc44264524ca979207e/step-0f4a7f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
